  "Description": {
    "Cost": 3153466,
    "UIName": "Pirate Ferret",
    "Id": "vehicledef_FERRET_1_PIRATE",
    "Name": "Pirate Ferret",
    "Details": "The Ferret is an advanced 45 ton fast attack Hovertank. In particular this looks like it was originally a Mark 1, or as it's commonly called 'The Dook.' It's mostly there, except the LAMS, with some typical pirate changes. They swapped the Reactive armor for Reflective +Spall Liner for some reason. And there's a pair of really weird 2-tube NARC launchers with shaped charge pods loaded instead of the Streak SRM. It's janky but I bet it would really mess up the insides of anything it hits.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Reflective Coating\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       180     25\n<b>Left</b>         125     25\n<b>Right</b>       125     25\n<b>Rear</b>         90     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      520    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Slippery Customer</color>",
    "Icon": "SLDFDrone"
  },
